i></mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5.</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"green\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>✓</mi></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nSo, we can use the normal approximation of the binomial distribution.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"</p>\n</div>",
